# The payment backend.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ means it is inlined into the browser bundle, which is correct
# here: this is a public base URL, not a secret. This storefront holds no
# secrets at all — no API keys, no database credentials, no Paystack keys.
# If something here ever needs to be secret, it belongs on the backend.
#
# Payment only — products and prices are hard-coded in src/lib/products.ts, so
# the shop browses fine without it. Checkout does not.
#
# This is an ngrok tunnel and ngrok free URLs change every restart. When it
# stops working, that is almost always why: get the new one and update this.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="https://3edd-105-113-109-223.ngrok-free.app/api"
